# The Worldgorger Dragon loop is no draw when tapping lands can buy something (CR 104.4b's last sentence, CR 106.4): Bot1
# holds Withering Torment ({2}{B}), which its two Swamps can't pay for at once - so it is never offered at priority - but
# the Swamps come back untapped each time round the loop and mana stays in the pool until the step ends. Bot1 lets the
# loop go round ten times without tapping them - far past where a loop of mandatory actions is found, and no draw: tapping
# them is a choice that could pay for the Torment - then taps them two times round in a row, floating four black mana, and with the Dragon's third enters ability on the stack
# casts Withering Torment on the Dragon: Bot1 loses 2 life, the Dragon's leaves ability returns nothing (nothing is exiled
# with it yet), Animate Dead goes to the graveyard enchanting nothing (CR 704.5m), and the enters ability then exiles both
# Swamps for good. One black mana is left floating.

